    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάκος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sage-apple, Salvia calycina</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				325
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
